## 🚫 Batman's Additional Terms  
*(What "Being a Dick" Specifically Includes for This Repository)*

### 1. NO IMPERSONATION  
Don't fork, copy, or modify this work to imply it's official, original, or affiliated with the author.  
→ *"You're not Batman. Stop pretending."*

### 2. NO COMMERCIAL EXPLOITATION  
Don't sell this repository's content (code/docs/guides) as:  
- Paid eBooks/courses  
- Subscription-based "unmodified" SaaS  
- Repackaged products without significant original work  
→ *"Build your own Batcave – don't resell mine."*

### 3. NO HARM OR DECEPTION  
Don't use this work for:  
- Malicious attacks or unauthorized intrusion  
- Hate speech, harassment, or discrimination  
- Fraud, scams, or political manipulation  
- Spreading technical misinformation  
→ *"With great tech comes great responsibility."*

### 4. ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT  
Forks/derivatives must:  
- Clearly link to the [original repository](https://github.com/your/repo)  
- State "Based on [Project Name] by [Your Name]"  
→ *"Give credit where it's due, Robin."*

